      "id": "studio-desk-guide",
      "kind": "other",
      "label": "Media studio desk guide · 2026-07-14",
      "text": "An employee emails the preferred recording date and programme name to the media desk. The studio coordinator records the request in the booking sheet and checks the studio calendar. If the slot is available, the coordinator emails a confirmation; if it is unavailable, the coordinator emails a decline and asks for another date. For a confirmed slot, the employee shows a staff card at reception. The receptionist checks the booking sheet and hands over the studio key. After the session, the employee must return the key to reception by 17:00, and the receptionist marks it returned in the booking sheet. The guide sets no response target and does not describe after-hours return."
    }
  ],
